@@title SQ-GSH Glass shards load without Creative Loot; shards in mid-tier chests, 2026-11-22 ([glass_shards.md](../glass_shards.md) 7, GSH-08, GSH-09; [publish_readiness.md](../publish_readiness.md) PR-CC-03, ruling P1; TODO `creative-common-publish #12`)
@@date 2026-11-22
@@jars creativecompat creativeloot
