## SQ-GSH-08 | Compat and Quark without Creative Loot: the modifier loads from the Forge list, glass breaks into shards
@group B (Compat + Quark, no Creative Loot)
@commands boot `cc_only` with Quark and without Creative Loot; rerun SQ-GSH-04 and SQ-GSH-07
@pass both rows PASS (blue pane -> blue shards, tinted glass -> dirty shards); no `[GlmMerge]` line (Creative Loot absent)
@fails Forge list `data/forge/loot_modifiers/global_loot_modifiers.json` missing from the jar or `replace` true; codec registration in `CreativeCompat.java`
@draft modset spec to pick: `cc_only full` minus Creative Loot; the runner chains the two rows
## SQ-GSH-09 | mid-tier chest tables roll glass shards, mostly dirty or clear
@group A
@reviewed 2026-11-24
@commands `/loot spawn` minecraft:chests/simple_dungeon 40 times at a cleared spot, then `/cdevtest items` there
@pass `quark:dirty_shard` or `quark:clear_shard` among the items (about 12 of 40 rolls carry 1 to 3 shards); colored shards, if any, fewer than dirty plus clear; `/loottuning` lists the `glass shards` pool add for 12 tables
@fails no shards: the `L.addPool` block in `07_rules.js` (Quark's dirty shard not registered skips it), or the table list
> forceload add 3200 3200 3216 3216
> fill 3200 -60 3200 3210 -50 3210 minecraft:air
repeat 40
> loot spawn 3205 -58 3205 loot minecraft:chests/simple_dungeon
end
sleep 2
> cdevtest items 3205 -58 3205 6
waitlog verb=items 30
expect verb=items .*quark:(dirty|clear)_shard
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|\[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=))
look dirty plus clear shards outnumber the colored ones

@@section 3
@@title SQ-GSH glass shards moved to Creative Compat: serializer id, Forge list, old-save safety, 2026-11-24 ([glass_shards.md](../glass_shards.md) 7; TODO `creative-common-publish #12`, `#17`)
@@date 2026-11-24
@@jars creativecompat creativecommon creativeloot
@@sources feature_writeup/glass_shards.md development/creativeCompat/src/main/resources/data/forge/loot_modifiers/global_loot_modifiers.json development/creativeCompat/src/main/resources/data/creativecompat/glm_entries.json
@@text Compat ships the modifier (`creativecompat:glass_shards`), its Forge list and its `glm_entries.json`; Common ships none. Quark on.
@@table
## SQ-GSH-10 | Compat alone (no Creative Loot): a broken glass pane drops shards
@group B (Compat + Quark, no Creative Loot)
@commands boot Compat + Quark without Creative Loot; break a blue stained glass pane and a Create framed glass block with a bot (`/cdevtest loot ... rolls=20`)
@pass blue shards from the pane, clear shards from the framed glass; latest.log has no `Missing` line for `creativecompat:glass_shards` and no `[GlmMerge]` line
@fails Forge list `data/forge/loot_modifiers/global_loot_modifiers.json` in Compat's jar (replace false); serializer registration in `CreativeCompat.java`
@modset cpp_chain compat +Quark-3.4-* +AutoRegLib-* +create-1.19.2-*
# r1124gate (2026-11-24, runner-4): Common + Compat (+ Calendar, Serene Seasons) plus Quark and Create, no Creative Loot;
# drop ranges as SQ-GSH-03 / -04 (1 to 2 per pane, 1 to 3 per glass block, rolls 20). Group B, y 200 over the world.
shell ls mods | grep -iE "^(creativeloot|creativecompat|creativecommon|Quark|create-)" ; ! ls mods | grep -qi "^creativeloot-"
bootreject \[GlmMerge\]
bootreject ^(?=.*([Mm]issing|[Uu]nknown|[Ff]ailed|ERROR|[Ee]xception)).*creativecompat:glass_shards
> forceload add 5344 5200 5359 5215
sleep 3
> fill 5344 199 5200 5359 199 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5344 200 5200 5359 203 5215 minecraft:air
> setblock 5351 200 5201 minecraft:blue_stained_glass_pane
> setblock 5347 200 5201 create:framed_glass
> cdevtest loot 5351 200 5201 rolls=20
expect verb=loot .*rolls=20 drops=\S*quark:blue_shard:(2\d|3\d|40)\b
> cdevtest loot 5347 200 5201 rolls=20
expect verb=loot .*rolls=20 drops=\S*(quark:clear_shard:([2-5]\d|60)\b|create:framed_glass:20\b)
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
> forceload remove 5344 5200 5359 5215
look blue shards 20 to 40 from the pane; clear shards 20 to 60 from framed glass (or framed glass 20 times if it drops itself, as SQ-GSH-03); no GlmMerge line
## SQ-GSH-11 | Compat with Creative Loot: one merged entry, shards drop once
@group B (full pack)
@commands boot the full pack; `[GlmMerge]` line; break a blue pane
@pass `[GlmMerge]` counts the Compat fragment and no `skipped: creativecompat:glass_shards`; one stack of shards per pane, not two
@fails `data/creativecompat/glm_entries.json` (fragment); GlmMerge duplicate handling
@modset none
# r1124gate (2026-11-24, runner-4): SQ-GSH-01's boot checks plus one pane: a doubled entry would give 40 to 80 shards.
bootexpect \[GlmMerge\] \d+ entries \(lists: \d+ files, \d+ entries; fragments: \d+ files
bootreject \[GlmMerge\] skipped:.*creativecompat:glass_shards
bootreject \[GlmMerge\] could not read
bootreject ^(?=.*([Mm]issing|[Uu]nknown)).*(creativecompat|creativecommon):glass_shards
shell unzip -p mods/creativecompat-*.jar data/creativecompat/glm_entries.json | grep -q "creativecompat:glass_shards"
shell unzip -p mods/creativecompat-*.jar data/forge/loot_modifiers/global_loot_modifiers.json | grep -q "creativecompat:glass_shards"
> forceload add 5344 5200 5359 5215
sleep 3
> fill 5344 199 5200 5359 199 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5344 200 5200 5359 203 5215 minecraft:air
> setblock 5351 200 5204 minecraft:blue_stained_glass_pane
> cdevtest loot 5351 200 5204 rolls=20
expect verb=loot .*rolls=20 drops=quark:blue_shard:(2\d|3\d|40)(\s|$)
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
> forceload remove 5344 5200 5359 5215
look the GlmMerge line is there with no glass_shards skip; the pane gave one stack of 20 to 40 blue shards (not 40 to 80)
## SQ-GSH-12 | Common alone (no Compat): no glass_shards modifier, no warning
@group B (Common, no Compat)
@commands boot Common without Compat; grep latest.log for `glass_shards`
@pass no `glass_shards` line, no loot modifier error; a glass pane drops what Quark gives
@fails Common still shipping a Forge list entry or fragment (it must not)
@modset cc_only full
# r1124gate (2026-11-24, runner-4): cc_only full has no Compat (its manifest forbids creativecompat-*) and keeps Quark;
# without the modifier a vanilla pane drops nothing (empty table without Silk Touch) and glass gives Quark's 2 to 4.
shell ls mods | grep -iE "^(creativecompat|creativeloot|creativecommon|Quark)" ; ! ls mods | grep -qiE "^creative(compat|loot)-"
shell ! unzip -l mods/creativecommon-*.jar | grep -E "glass_shards|glm_entries|data/forge/loot_modifiers"
bootreject (creativecompat|creativecommon):glass_shards|GlassShards
bootreject (?i)^(?=.*loot.?modifier).*(error|exception|failed|could not)
> forceload add 5344 5200 5359 5215
sleep 3
> fill 5344 199 5200 5359 199 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5344 200 5200 5359 203 5215 minecraft:air
> setblock 5351 200 5207 minecraft:blue_stained_glass_pane
> setblock 5345 200 5207 minecraft:glass
> cdevtest loot 5351 200 5207 rolls=20
> cdevtest loot 5345 200 5207 rolls=20
expect verb=loot state="?minecraft:blue_stained_glass_pane\b.*rolls=20 drops=-
expect verb=loot state="?minecraft:glass\b.*rolls=20 drops=quark:clear_shard:([4-7]\d|80)(\s|$)
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
> forceload remove 5344 5200 5359 5215
look no glass_shards line in the boot log; the pane dropped nothing, glass only Quark's 40 to 80 clear shards
